From 0af19618c999f26c8b36a7339462be9261a93454 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Grische <github@grische.xyz>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 21:11:33 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 12/18] fixup! gluon-mesh-batman-adv: periodic safety-net for
 tunnel-throughput

---
 .../micron.d/gluon-mesh-batman-adv-tunnel-throughput | 12 ++++++------
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

diff --git a/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/files/usr/lib/micron.d/gluon-mesh-batman-adv-tunnel-throughput b/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/files/usr/lib/micron.d/gluon-mesh-batman-adv-tunnel-throughput
index e2d48ba8..7f75af6c 100644
--- a/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/files/usr/lib/micron.d/gluon-mesh-batman-adv-tunnel-throughput
+++ b/package/gluon-mesh-batman-adv/files/usr/lib/micron.d/gluon-mesh-batman-adv-tunnel-throughput
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
-# Periodic re-evaluation of the tunnel-throughput override. The
-# hotplug.d/iface handler only fires on netifd ifup/ifdown of the wan
-# UCI iface; it misses intra-bridge cable moves (multiple role=uplink
-# ports bridged into one wan iface). This re-runs the worker every
-# 10 minutes so the override converges within bounded time. The worker
-# is idempotent and no-ops on Batman-IV.
+# Periodic re-evaluation of the tunnel-throughput override.
+# hotplug.d/iface handler only fires on netifd ifup/ifdown of the wan UCI iface
+# it misses intra-bridge cable moves (multiple role=uplink ports bridged into one
+# wan iface).
+# Re-running the worker every 10 minutes makes sure it converges within bounded time.
+# The worker is idempotent and no-ops on Batman-IV.
 */10 * * * * ACTION=ifup INTERFACE=wan /lib/gluon/mesh-batman-adv/tunnel-throughput.lua
